{"id":"240ebbea-abe3-47f5-8913-a5753a57692e","createdAt":"2026-10-27T06:17:08.396Z","batchId":"onboarding_qwen3-8-flash-gateway_medium","approach":"html","modelId":"qwen3.8-flash-gateway","settings":{"effort":"medium"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n\n    <!-- Step Indicator -->\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"step-indicator-card\">\n      <div class=\"row\" id=\"stepper\" style=\"justify-content:center;gap:var(--gap-lg);\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-step=\"1\">\n          <span class=\"avatar\" id=\"av1\" style=\"background:var(--primary);color:#fff;\">1</span>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <span class=\"small\" id=\"lbl1\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">Account</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">Sign up</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:48px;height:2px;background:var(--border);align-self:center;\" id=\"conn1\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-step=\"2\">\n          <span class=\"avatar\" id=\"av2\">2</span>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <span class=\"small\" id=\"lbl2\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">Preferences</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">Personalise</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"width:48px;height:2px;background:var(--border);align-self:center;\" id=\"conn2\"></div>\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" data-step=\"3\">\n          <span class=\"avatar\" id=\"av3\">3</span>\n          <div class=\"stack\" style=\"align-items:flex-start;\">\n            <span class=\"small\" id=\"lbl3\" style=\"font-weight:700;\">Done</span>\n            <span class=\"muted small\">Confirm</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 1: Account -->\n    <div id=\"panel-account\" class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Create your account</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Enter your details to get started. All fields are required.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Full name</span>\n            <input type=\"text\" id=\"in-name\" placeholder=\"Jordan Rivera\" autocomplete=\"name\">\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Work email</span>\n            <input type=\"email\" id=\"in-email\" placeholder=\"jordan@company.com\" autocomplete=\"email\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Password</span>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"in-pass\" placeholder=\"Min. 8 characters\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Confirm password</span>\n            <input type=\"password\" id=\"in-pass2\" placeholder=\"Re-enter password\" autocomplete=\"new-password\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <label>\n          <span class=\"up\">Organisation / team</span>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"in-org\" placeholder=\"Acme Design Studio\">\n        </label>\n        <div id=\"err-account\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"display:none;\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 2: Preferences -->\n    <div id=\"panel-prefs\" class=\"card\" style=\"display:none;\">\n      <h2>Set your preferences</h2>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Tailor the experience to how you work. You can change these later.</p>\n      <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"up\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:var(--gap-sm);\">Theme</span>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"System\" checked> System default</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"Light\"> Light</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"theme\" value=\"Dark\"> Dark</label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Timezone</span>\n            <select id=\"in-tz\">\n              <option value=\"UTC−08:00 · Pacific\">UTC−08:00 · Pacific</option>\n              <option value=\"UTC−05:00 · Eastern\">UTC−05:00 · Eastern</option>\n              <option value=\"UTC+00:00 · London\">UTC+00:00 · London</option>\n              <option value=\"UTC+01:00 · Berlin\">UTC+01:00 · Berlin</option>\n              <option value=\"UTC+05:30 · India\">UTC+05:30 · India</option>\n              <option value=\"UTC+09:00 · Tokyo\">UTC+09:00 · Tokyo</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n          <label>\n            <span class=\"up\">Language</span>\n            <select id=\"in-lang\">\n              <option>English (US)</option>\n              <option>English (UK)</option>\n              <option>Deutsch</option>\n              <option>Français</option>\n              <option>日本語</option>\n            </select>\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"up\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:var(--gap-sm);\">Notifications</span>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-email\" checked> Email digests (daily)</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-push\" checked> Push notifications on mobile</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"chk-mentions\"> Mentions & replies only</label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"up\" style=\"display:block;margin-bottom:var(--gap-sm);\">Focus areas</span>\n          <div class=\"row gap-sm\">\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-des\" checked> Design</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-eng\"> Engineering</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-mark\"> Marketing</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-data\"> Data</label>\n            <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"f-ops\"> Operations</label>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <label>\n          <span class=\"up\">About you <span class=\"muted small\">(optional)</span></span>\n          <textarea id=\"in-bio\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"Product designer passionate about design systems…\"></textarea>\n        </label>\n        <div id=\"err-prefs\" class=\"alert alert-destructive\" style=\"display:none;\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Step 3: Done -->\n    <div id=\"panel-done\" style=\"display:none;\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n          <span class=\"badge\" style=\"background:var(--primary);color:#fff;\">✓ Complete</span>\n          <h2 style=\"margin:0;\">You're all set, <span id=\"sum-name-short\">Jordan</span>!</h2>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"lead muted\">Here's a summary of what you entered. Double-check before launching your dashboard.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Account</h3>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Full name</span><strong id=\"sum-name\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Email</span><strong id=\"sum-email\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Organisation</span><strong id=\"sum-org\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Password</span><strong>••••••••</strong></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"card\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title\">Preferences</h3>\n          <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Theme</span><strong id=\"sum-theme\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Timezone</span><strong id=\"sum-tz\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Language</span><strong id=\"sum-lang\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Focus areas</span><strong id=\"sum-focus\">—</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"row between\"><span class=\"muted small\">Notifications</span><strong id=\"sum-notif\">—</strong></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\" id=\"done-extra\">\n        <div class=\"row between\" style=\"align-items:center;\">\n          <div>\n            <h3 class=\"card-title\" style=\"margin-bottom:4px;\">Welcome aboard 🎉</h3>\n            <p class=\"muted\">Your workspace is ready. The guided tour will highlight key features the first time you log in.</p>\n          </div>\n          <span class=\"avatar\" style=\"font-size:1.4rem;\">🚀</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Navigation buttons -->\n    <div class=\"row between\" style=\"margin-top:var(--gap-sm);\">\n      <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" id=\"btn-back\" style=\"visibility:hidden;\">← Back</button>\n      <button class=\"btn\" id=\"btn-next\">Next →</button>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"text-align:center;\">Step <span id=\"step-num\">1</span> of 3 · <span id=\"step-pct-wrap\"><progress style=\"width:80px;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle;\"><div style=\"width:33%\"></div></progress></span></p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .avatar{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;font-size:.82rem;font-weight:700;transition:background .2s,color .2s;}\n  #stepper .row.gap-sm{align-items:center;}\n  #stepper .stack{gap:0;}\n  .card{transition:box-shadow .15s;}\n</style>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  let step = 1;\n  const panels = ['panel-account','panel-prefs','panel-done'];\n  const btnNext = document.getElementById('btn-next');\n  const btnBack = document.getElementById('btn-back');\n  const stepNum = document.getElementById('step-num');\n  const progress = document.querySelector('#step-pct-wrap div');\n\n  function updateStepper(){\n    for(let i=1;i<=3;i++){\n      const av = document.getElementById('av'+i);\n      const lbl = document.getElementById('lbl'+i);\n      if(i < step){ av.style.background='var(--primary)'; av.style.color='#fff'; av.textContent='✓'; }\n      else if(i === step){ av.style.background='var(--primary)'; av.style.color='#fff'; av.textContent=i; }\n      else { av.style.background='var(--muted-foreground)'; av.style.color='var(--background)'; av.textContent=i; }\n      lbl.style.color = i <= step ? 'var(--foreground)' : 'var(--muted-foreground)';\n    }\n    document.getElementById('conn1').style.background = step>1?'var(--primary)':'var(--border)';\n    document.getElementById('conn2').style.background = step>2?'var(--primary)':'var(--border)';\n  }\n\n  function showPanel(){\n    panels.forEach(id=> document.getElementById(id).style.display = (id==='panel-'+['account','prefs','done'][step-1])?'':'none');\n    btnBack.style.visibility = step===1?'hidden':'visible';\n    btnNext.textContent = step===3?'Go to dashboard ✦':'Next →';\n    stepNum.textContent = step;\n    progress.style.width = (step/3*100)+'%';\n  }\n\n  function validate(){\n    if(step===1){\n      const n=document.getElementById('in-name').value.trim();\n      const e=document.getElementById('in-email').value.trim();\n      const p=document.getElementById('in-pass').value;\n      const p2=document.getElementById('in-pass2').value;\n      const o=document.getElementById('in-org').value.trim();\n      const err=document.getElementById('err-account');\n      let msg='';\n      if(!n) msg+='Full name is required. ';\n      if(!e || !e.includes('@')) msg+='Enter a valid email. ';\n      if(p.length<8) msg+='Password must be ≥ 8 characters. ';\n      if(p!==p2) msg+='Passwords do not match. ';\n      if(!o) msg+='Organisation name is required.';\n      err.textContent=msg; err.style.display=msg?'':'none';\n      return !msg;\n    }\n    if(step===2){\n      const tz=document.getElementById('in-tz').value;\n      const err=document.getElementById('err-prefs');\n      if(!tz){err.textContent='Select a timezone.';err.style.display='';return false;}\n      err.style.display='none';\n      return true;\n    }\n    return true;\n  }\n\n  function fillSummary(){\n    const n=document.getElementById('in-name').value.trim();\n    document.getElementById('sum-name').textContent=n;\n    document.getElementById('sum-name-short').textContent=n.split(' ')[0]||'friend';\n    document.getElementById('sum-email').textContent=document.getElementById('in-email').value.trim();\n    document.getElementById('sum-org').textContent=document.getElementById('in-org').value.trim();\n    document.getElementById('sum-theme').textContent=document.querySelector('input[name=\"theme\"]:checked').value;\n    document.getElementById('sum-tz').textContent=document.getElementById('in-tz').value;\n    document.getElementById('sum-lang').textContent=document.getElementById('in-lang').value;\n    const areas=[];['f-des','f-eng','f-mark','f-data','f-ops'].forEach(id=>{if(document.getElementById(id).checked)areas.push(document.getElementById(id).parentElement.textContent.trim());});\n    document.getElementById('sum-focus').textContent=areas.length?areas.join(', '):'None selected';\n    const notifs=[];\n    if(document.getElementById('chk-email').checked)notifs.push('Email');\n    if(document.getElementById('chk-push').checked)notifs.push('Push');\n    if(document.getElementById('chk-mentions').checked)notifs.push('Mentions');\n    document.getElementById('sum-notif').textContent=notifs.length?notifs.join(', '):'Off';\n  }\n\n  btnNext.addEventListener('click',()=>{\n    if(step<3 && !validate()) return;\n    if(step===2){ step=3; fillSummary(); }\n    else if(step<3) step++;\n    else{ alert('🎉 Redirecting to your dashboard…'); }\n    updateStepper(); showPanel();\n    window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});\n  });\n\n  btnBack.addEventListener('click',()=>{\n    if(step>1){\n      step--;\n      updateStepper(); showPanel();\n      window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});\n    }\n  });\n\n  updateStepper(); showPanel();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[5013,"<div class=\"page"],[5069,"\">\n  <"],[5079,"div class=\"stack"],[5274," gap-lg\">\n\n"],[5330,"    <!-- Step Indicator"],[5341," -->\n    <"],[5351,"div class=\"card"],[5477,"\" id=\"step"],[5490,"-ind"],[5512,"icator-card\">\n"],[5524,"      <"],[5614,"div class=\"row"],[5624,"\" id=\"ste"],[5714,"pper\" style=\""],[5891,"justify-content:center;"],[5902,"gap"],[5902,":var(--gap"],[5902,"-lg);\">\n"],[5958,"        <div class"],[5968,"=\""],[6027,"row gap-sm\""],[6037," data"],[6037,"-step=\"1\">"],[6064,"\n          <"],[6097,"span class=\"avatar"],[6106,"\" id=\"av"],[6237,"1\" style=\""],[6244,"background"],[6301,":var(--primary"],[6333,");color:#fff"],[6344,";\">"],[6344,"1</span>"],[6470,"\n          <div"],[6538," class=\"stack\""],[6573," style=\"align-items"],[6584,":flex-start;\">"],[6643,"\n            <span"],[6677," class=\"small